WEBVTT

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:08.740
Zaizen, the Queen's defeat 
is bad for SOL Technologies.

00:00:08.990 --> 00:00:13.930
If the public finds out, SOL 
Technologies' stock will crash!

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:19.560
Zaizen, bring this situation 
under control immediately.

00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:27.090
Executive Director Zaizen, who 
was your emergency meeting with?

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:28.470
The Kings.

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:33.220
King?  Isn't the Queen our top executive?

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:37.130
There's a King?  And plural - Kings?

00:00:37.130 --> 00:00:41.000
The Kings are our company's 
major stockholders.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:45.380
I see.  What did they say?

00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:47.530
Whatever they want.

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:51.800
Yusaku!

00:00:53.340 --> 00:00:54.700
Umm...

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:57.820
W-Well...  It's...

00:00:57.820 --> 00:00:58.940
What is it?

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:01.260
What's wrong?

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:03.400
Never mind.

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:05.480
Are you sure?

00:01:05.740 --> 00:01:07.610
Sorry, it's fine.

00:01:07.610 --> 00:01:09.280
Nothing important.

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:13.900
It's Kusanagi.

00:01:14.810 --> 00:01:16.790
He wants us to come right away.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:18.520
Right away?

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:23.530
An e-mail to your anonymous address?

00:01:23.530 --> 00:01:27.610
Yeah.  He says he wants to 
meet Playmaker and Soulburner.

00:01:27.610 --> 00:01:29.780
Who's the sender?

00:01:29.780 --> 00:01:31.300
Zaizen.

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:36.250
LINK VRAINS is shut down, but 
he's waiting at Central Station.

00:01:36.250 --> 00:01:38.540
Is it a trap?

00:01:38.540 --> 00:01:40.150
I don't think so.

00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:46.620
Due to the recent incident, SOL Technologies 
removed Playmaker from the wanted list.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:48.590
What should we do, Yusaku?

00:01:48.590 --> 00:01:51.820
Let's go.  Something may have happened.

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:54.790
I'll also go this time.

00:01:57.450 --> 00:02:06.720
calling & feeling  I take your 
thoughts to heart  VRAINS

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:34.680
The data storm grazes my cheek, 
so I can't open my eyes

00:02:35.320 --> 00:02:44.600
What are we trying to find?  
Where are we trying to go?

00:02:45.190 --> 00:02:49.840
I won't make anyone sad anymore

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:58.380
I'll retrieve you  Let's go and look ahead

00:02:58.670 --> 00:03:03.520
By meeting you, the world is in color

00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:09.190
I'll protect you with an unseen bond

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:13.500
calling  With invisible wings

00:03:13.820 --> 00:03:24.110
Destroy the dark and weakness within me

00:03:44.130 --> 00:03:48.200
Thanks for coming, Playmaker and Soulburner.

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:49.170
And you're...

00:03:50.840 --> 00:03:53.370
I'm Unnamed.  I provide support.

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:55.860
So you're the guy.  Nice to meet you.

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:58.650
What did you want to talk about?

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:00.820
Let's wait until everyone arrives.

00:04:00.820 --> 00:04:02.590
Others are coming?

00:04:04.820 --> 00:04:10.560
Blood Shepherd!  Ghost Girl!  And Go Onizuka!

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:13.800
Go Onizuka, you're okay now?

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:18.040
Sort of.  I want to thank you.

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:19.770
What for?

00:04:20.980 --> 00:04:22.510
You never change.

00:04:22.510 --> 00:04:27.130
If you brought together this lineup, 
something big must have happened.

00:04:29.560 --> 00:04:32.560
I'll keep this short.

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:36.220
Yesterday, SOL Technologies' 
top executive was attacked.

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:38.880
How disturbing.

00:04:39.980 --> 00:04:44.060
The culprit commited the crime 
by hacking my company's SOLtiS.

00:04:44.060 --> 00:04:48.300
You were attacked by your 
own product?  How funny.

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:51.300
It's not funny for us.

00:04:51.780 --> 00:04:57.280
The culprit stole our executive's 
code key to our mainframe.

00:04:57.280 --> 00:04:59.290
It's becoming clear now.

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:02.150
You want us to retrieve it.

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:06.890
No.  I want you to protect me.

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:10.420
Protect you?  What do you mean?

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:13.430
The code key is split in two.

00:05:13.430 --> 00:05:15.620
The Queen and I each had one.

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:18.120
It won't work unless you combine the two.

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:23.670
The culprit left a message saying he'll 
attack me in three days and steal the code key.

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:25.730
That's why you want us to protect you.

00:05:25.730 --> 00:05:31.540
Umm... I'm clueless about these things, 
so what happens if it's stolen?

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:35.460
He can infiltrate SOL 
Technologies' central computer.

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:39.780
And completely take over the company.

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:45.400
SOL Technologies has over 
30% share of the network.

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:48.530
So it plays a major role in 
society's infrastructure.

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:55.630
If it falls into his hands, he can 
destroy society's infrastructure.

00:05:55.840 --> 00:06:00.870
And he can take over all the 
SOLtiS, which are now being sold.

00:06:00.870 --> 00:06:04.200
Won't that be a huge problem?

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:06.020
Yes.

00:06:06.540 --> 00:06:09.780
Do you have an idea who the culprit is?

00:06:09.780 --> 00:06:13.020
I have more than an idea.  
He revealed his own identity.

00:06:13.950 --> 00:06:15.820
How audacious.

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:18.820
This is the message he left.

00:06:20.340 --> 00:06:21.830
Hi!

00:06:21.830 --> 00:06:23.720
Hooray!

00:06:23.720 --> 00:06:27.340
Zaizen, I defeated the Queen.

00:06:27.340 --> 00:06:28.170
That's right!

00:06:29.630 --> 00:06:31.100
They're SOLtiS.

00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:35.700
Zaizen, now you're SOL Technologies' #1.

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:36.800
That's right!

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:40.980
I took her code key.

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:44.850
Who's controlling this SOLtiS?

00:06:45.060 --> 00:06:49.590
Oh yeah.  Let me reintroduce myself.

00:06:50.170 --> 00:06:52.190
I'm Ai.

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:55.460
Ai?

00:06:57.900 --> 00:06:59.860
I'm Roboppi!

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:01.600
Roboppi?

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:06.600
Zaizen, I'm coming for your 
code key three days from now.

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:09.940
I know you just became #1, but...  Sorry.

00:07:09.940 --> 00:07:12.760
Enjoy being #1 for three days.

00:07:12.760 --> 00:07:13.610
See you.

00:07:13.610 --> 00:07:15.490
That's right!

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:19.020
Ai...

00:07:19.320 --> 00:07:20.790
No way...

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:23.200
What's going on?

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:25.000
Why would Ai do this?

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:26.790
I don't know.

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:30.200
That's all the footage he left.

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:35.170
But it's clear he's declaring 
war on SOL Technologies.

00:07:35.540 --> 00:07:40.770
I heard Ai vanished, but he 
actually wants revenge on SOL?

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:44.740
He's an AI.  He's become humanity's enemy.

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:49.680
Playmaker, I bet you know where he is.

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:52.780
Hey!  You're accusing Playmaker?

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:56.420
He's the human who's friendliest 
with the Dark Ignis.

00:07:56.420 --> 00:07:57.800
Stop it!

00:07:57.800 --> 00:08:01.760
He fought for humans and AIs to coexist!

00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:05.420
If he knew, he would have already acted!

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:06.890
That's true.

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:13.740
Playmaker, I know it'll be tough to 
decide whether you want to fight or not.

00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:15.940
But I want you to help me.

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:18.640
You know more about Ai than anyone.

00:08:20.410 --> 00:08:23.110
Give me some time.

00:08:25.220 --> 00:08:31.640
I couldn't say this earlier, but 
I'm thinking of going back home.

00:08:31.640 --> 00:08:33.460
I see.

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:35.880
But I've changed my mind.

00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:39.130
I want to meet Ai again now.

00:08:39.650 --> 00:08:45.140
If I learn what Ai is thinking, 
I might learn more about Flame.

00:08:45.140 --> 00:08:48.140
I think I'll help Zaizen.

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:49.470
I see.

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:51.460
What will you do?

00:08:51.820 --> 00:08:55.210
Ai was smiling.

00:08:55.210 --> 00:08:57.050
He was having fun.

00:08:57.300 --> 00:09:01.220
He hurt people, as if it was a game.

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:02.450
Yusaku...

00:09:03.160 --> 00:09:07.130
But I want to trust Ai.

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:12.400
You actually came alone.

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:14.370
The enemy of my enemy is my friend.

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:19.600
Did you find the Dark Ignis's location?

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:23.090
We're doing the best we can, 
but I doubt we'll find him.

00:09:23.090 --> 00:09:28.580
You're right.  He's better 
at fleeing than we are.

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:33.420
He did hide from us in the 
network for five years.

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:37.060
If we can't find him, my 
life will end in three days.

00:09:37.060 --> 00:09:42.450
The Dark Ignis is a powerful enemy, 
but I won't let that happen.

00:09:42.450 --> 00:09:44.370
I have a plan.

00:09:44.370 --> 00:09:47.800
I can't believe you're going to protect me.

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:49.420
Come!

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:54.780
Who is she?

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:59.010
It's an AI we created to hunt the Ignis.

00:10:01.340 --> 00:10:05.220
Nice to meet you.  My name is Pandor.

00:10:05.220 --> 00:10:09.790
According to myth, Ignis was the fire taken 
from the world of the gods

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:12.470
to give humans knowledge.

00:10:12.530 --> 00:10:19.840
But that disgusted the gods, so they sent 
one woman to bring calamity to humans.

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:21.570
Her name was Pandora.

00:10:21.570 --> 00:10:25.920
I never thought you'd create 
an AI similar to the Ignis.

00:10:25.920 --> 00:10:30.580
It's inevitable that AI with free 
will will come into existence.

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:34.050
But I won't let them do whatever they like.

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:37.280
This is how we're taking the initiative.

00:10:37.520 --> 00:10:41.750
Pandor has a built-in program 
that limits free will.

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:48.730
If it starts to view humans as the enemy, 
those thoughts will automatically be erased.

00:10:48.730 --> 00:10:51.200
That kind of control is possible?

00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:52.940
For now.

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:57.400
We're harmless to humans.

00:10:57.400 --> 00:10:59.370
There are four?

00:10:59.370 --> 00:11:02.850
We four are linked together.

00:11:02.850 --> 00:11:08.380
If one battles an enemy, all data 
will be shared with the other three.

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:11.850
Look at your Duel Disk.

00:11:14.090 --> 00:11:18.760
We're loaded with all duel 
data, up to the present.

00:11:18.760 --> 00:11:23.880
We'll use it to help the duelist by 
figuring out the enemy's intentions.

00:11:23.880 --> 00:11:28.060
AIs are best at predicting 
an AI's intentions.

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:31.570
We will protect you.

00:11:31.570 --> 00:11:33.270
I'm counting on you.

00:11:33.270 --> 00:11:36.740
Zaizen, there's one more 
thing I want to discuss.

00:11:59.620 --> 00:12:00.900
Ai...

00:12:20.690 --> 00:12:22.400
Fujiki!

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:23.320
What is it?

00:12:23.320 --> 00:12:27.360
Do you know where Playmaker is?

00:12:27.360 --> 00:12:32.530
LINK VRAINS is closed, so I don't 
know where I can go to meet him!

00:12:32.760 --> 00:12:34.900
What do you want with Playmaker?

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:39.740
Zaizen asked me how to contact Playmaker!

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:44.710
Since you're Playmaker's soulmate, 
I thought you could contact him.

00:12:44.980 --> 00:12:50.720
It's not cool if I say that I don't know!

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:52.740
What should I do?

00:12:52.740 --> 00:12:56.690
Oh, I know!  I'll ask the message boards!

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:01.820
Brother!

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:05.560
Is it safe to be out here?

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:09.030
And shouldn't you be at work?

00:13:09.030 --> 00:13:12.040
I wish you didn't run into me here.

00:13:12.040 --> 00:13:17.310
I wanted to burn where 
I live into my memories.

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:19.040
Brother...

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:22.420
Since I'm a target, I must be feeling scared.

00:13:22.420 --> 00:13:26.610
And I got everyone involved.  How pathetic.

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:31.810
Brother, are you hungry?

00:13:31.810 --> 00:13:33.890
I know a delicious hot dog stand.

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:36.130
Over there!

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:38.830
Thanks again!

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:43.330
He's...

00:13:45.570 --> 00:13:46.900
Zaizen...

00:13:47.690 --> 00:13:48.960
You're...

00:13:52.330 --> 00:13:56.200
I see.  You're Playmaker.

00:13:56.200 --> 00:13:58.180
So back then...

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:05.400
I know it's late, but thank you.

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:10.390
It feels weird to meet you in real life.

00:14:10.390 --> 00:14:15.130
I was just fighting for myself.

00:14:15.130 --> 00:14:16.720
I don't need thanks.

00:14:16.720 --> 00:14:17.730
I see.

00:14:21.930 --> 00:14:23.610
I see.  Okay.

00:14:23.610 --> 00:14:25.020
I'll be right there.

00:14:25.400 --> 00:14:28.340
Sorry.  I have to return to work.

00:14:30.240 --> 00:14:33.320
Playmaker-  I mean, Fujiki.

00:14:35.340 --> 00:14:37.120
I'm glad I could meet you.

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:39.520
If you'll excuse me.

00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:51.640
So Playmaker was always near me.

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:56.110
Shima said you're searching for Playmaker.

00:14:56.110 --> 00:15:00.080
Yes.  I wanted to stop Playmaker.

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:04.320
That's why I couldn't ask my 
brother about how to contact you.

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:05.280
Me?

00:15:07.040 --> 00:15:11.360
This upcoming battle will 
be against your partner.

00:15:11.360 --> 00:15:16.590
If I was told to battle Aqua or 
my brother, it'd be heartbreaking.

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:21.030
What was Aqua's final moments like?

00:15:21.030 --> 00:15:23.400
I didn't meet her in person.

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:25.270
But according to Ai...

00:15:27.720 --> 00:15:30.740
Please take it, Ai.

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:33.740
That is the last of our powers.

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:36.410
Use it to defeat Bohman!

00:15:37.480 --> 00:15:40.480
Ai, you're our final hope.

00:15:40.480 --> 00:15:42.150
We're counting on you.

00:15:42.380 --> 00:15:45.730
I see.  That's just like her.

00:15:45.730 --> 00:15:46.720
Yeah.

00:15:49.030 --> 00:15:52.030
I don't know what happened to Ai.

00:15:52.030 --> 00:15:56.530
But when I think about how you 
must feel, it breaks my heart too.

00:15:56.760 --> 00:16:01.270
So leave this battle to us!

00:16:03.260 --> 00:16:06.970
Yusaku Fujiki-  I mean, Playmaker.

00:16:06.970 --> 00:16:11.150
I actually wanted to meet you because 
there's something else I want to tell you.

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:18.820
You saved me and my brother many times.

00:16:18.820 --> 00:16:23.740
You were always by my side and protected me.

00:16:23.740 --> 00:16:25.700
I wanted to thank you.

00:16:25.700 --> 00:16:30.030
Thank you truly.  I'm grateful.

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:36.440
I want you to shake my hand.

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:49.850
This feels strange.

00:16:52.680 --> 00:16:54.160
See ya!

00:17:07.840 --> 00:17:09.540
Thank you, everyone!

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:10.640
Thanks for coming.

00:17:10.640 --> 00:17:12.480
Playmaker...

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:14.620
Like I thought, he's not coming.

00:17:14.620 --> 00:17:16.360
This is everyone?

00:17:16.360 --> 00:17:18.720
No.  There are others.

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:22.980
Revolver!

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:26.190
And Spectre and the three Knights of Hanoi!

00:17:26.190 --> 00:17:31.400
That's right.  I'm having 
them help in this battle.

00:17:31.640 --> 00:17:36.370
I see.  If we're hunting Ignis, 
everyone has the same goal.

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:42.080
But isn't your goal to get 
revenge on SOL Technologies?

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:45.780
Since the Light Ignis's 
scheme was revealed...

00:17:45.780 --> 00:17:49.110
...we no longer desire revenge 
against SOL Technologies.

00:17:49.320 --> 00:17:54.560
But Brother, it doesn't change the 
fact that they committed crimes.

00:17:54.560 --> 00:17:57.380
So teaming with them again is-

00:17:57.380 --> 00:18:01.440
As you said, our crimes don't just vanish.

00:18:01.440 --> 00:18:04.600
We're prepared to take responsibility.

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:06.580
What responsibility?

00:18:06.580 --> 00:18:08.830
You'll all get arrested?

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:10.300
Exactly.

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:16.400
The Knights of Hanoi's 
goal is to kill the Ignis.

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:20.380
When that's done, we won't 
have any reason to exist.

00:18:20.380 --> 00:18:25.380
After accomplishing our goal, 
we'll reveal everything to

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:27.600
the public and atone for our crimes.

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:33.590
You're right, but it doesn't feel right.

00:18:33.590 --> 00:18:38.730
If that happens, SOL Technologies 
won't get off scot-free.

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:43.090
You're right.  But that can't be helped.

00:18:43.090 --> 00:18:47.470
Trust built upon lies will 
eventually be exposed.

00:18:47.470 --> 00:18:52.100
Since you're currently the top 
executive, you'll take the fall.

00:18:52.100 --> 00:18:55.080
You'll take responsibility 
for what you didn't do?

00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:57.060
That's how companies are structured.

00:18:57.060 --> 00:18:58.920
And I accept it.

00:18:58.920 --> 00:19:00.650
Brother...

00:19:00.650 --> 00:19:06.120
Fine.  If that's how you feel, 
I won't say anything more.

00:19:06.120 --> 00:19:08.090
What's the plan?

00:19:09.530 --> 00:19:11.770
The battle will take place here.

00:19:11.770 --> 00:19:14.700
They'll come from somewhere here.

00:19:14.700 --> 00:19:18.300
We're currently at the center.

00:19:21.870 --> 00:19:24.880
We're in the circle courtyard at the center.

00:19:25.900 --> 00:19:29.880
Only these two routes connect to the outside.

00:19:30.220 --> 00:19:33.160
Blue Maiden and I will stay here.

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:38.060
You'll situate yourselves 
at the two routes' gateways.

00:19:38.060 --> 00:19:42.780
Ghost Girl, Blood Shepherd 
and Spectre on the east.

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:48.350
Go Onizuka and the three Knights 
of Hanoi on the west route.

00:19:49.800 --> 00:19:54.770
Revolver and Soulburner, you'll 
be at the outside gateways.

00:20:00.360 --> 00:20:03.860
If you see any signs of the enemy, go there.

00:20:03.860 --> 00:20:05.680
So we're the reserve corps.

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:07.650
Can I ask a question?

00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:13.280
Can't you deal with Ai's attack 
without logging into the network?

00:20:13.280 --> 00:20:18.920
No.  If he's attacked in real life, 
they may steal his consciousness.

00:20:18.920 --> 00:20:22.700
But what if they steal his body 
while he's in the network?

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:24.800
Don't worry about that.

00:20:24.800 --> 00:20:28.070
They definitely can't reach me.

00:20:28.730 --> 00:20:30.910
So you have countermeasures ready.

00:20:31.280 --> 00:20:36.880
Revolver, provide Blue Maiden, Ghost Girl 
and Go Onizuka with that special something.

00:20:40.220 --> 00:20:42.620
Look at your Duel Disks.

00:20:42.620 --> 00:20:46.200
I sent you Pandor, an anti-Ignis AI.

00:20:49.990 --> 00:20:53.000
Everyone, get to your positions!

00:20:59.260 --> 00:21:02.600
They've gathered at the center.

00:21:02.600 --> 00:21:04.910
So everyone has come.

00:21:05.540 --> 00:21:09.650
Blue Maiden, Soulburner, Revolver...

00:21:10.610 --> 00:21:16.090
Huh?  Master, Playmaker isn't there.

00:21:16.320 --> 00:21:18.320
He's not coming?

00:21:18.320 --> 00:21:19.600
Actually...

00:21:22.030 --> 00:21:22.890
That's...

00:21:27.230 --> 00:21:28.700
Playmaker!

00:21:28.920 --> 00:21:30.430
He came!

00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:36.240
This will be a difficult fight for me.

00:21:36.240 --> 00:21:43.050
But as Ai's partner, it's my duty to 
stop him from committing more crimes!

00:21:43.260 --> 00:21:47.020
That's right!  Nothing can 
start without Playmaker!

00:21:56.730 --> 00:22:02.290
Now let's go defeat everyone!

00:22:05.590 --> 00:22:09.560
I was told repeatedly

00:22:09.560 --> 00:22:17.010
Only tales of dreams

00:22:17.360 --> 00:22:23.980
Is my life precious?

00:22:24.240 --> 00:22:26.950
Make up for  Make up for

00:22:27.340 --> 00:22:34.490
The next sentimental

00:22:39.320 --> 00:22:45.740
I'm not a machine

00:22:48.460 --> 00:22:52.180
I cry a single tear

00:22:53.670 --> 00:22:57.380
A single answer moves me

00:22:58.570 --> 00:23:07.760
We helplessly sing for someone we can't reach

00:23:08.380 --> 00:23:13.190
Are you ready?

00:23:13.690 --> 00:23:18.540
Oh oh oh

00:23:19.060 --> 00:23:23.740
Are you ready?

00:23:24.360 --> 00:23:30.850
Are you ready?

00:23:37.730 --> 00:23:40.540
The fight has begun.

00:23:40.540 --> 00:23:45.370
There are ten enemies, 
but only two on our side.

00:23:45.370 --> 00:23:49.770
Roboppi is worried about their disadvantage.

00:23:49.770 --> 00:23:53.370
But this is a once-in-a-lifetime chance.

00:23:53.370 --> 00:23:56.730
Roboppi's boundless training begins!

00:23:56.730 --> 00:23:59.520
It's time for my first battle ever!

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:03.920
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
Good Luck, Roboppi!!

00:24:03.920 --> 00:24:06.360
Into the VRAINS!
